  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.8: Author-period manifests now preserve selected empty one-parent commits as valid zero-path transitions instead of rejecting them as missing Git objects. Empty commits remain represented without inventing effort, and the alpha.7 repository-level batch performance improvements are retained. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.8/CHANGELOG.md",
